      "id": "easy-23-google-sheet-row",
      "category": "easy",
      "language": "ko",
      "prompt": "Receipts 폴더에 영수증 PDF가 들어오면 금액이랑 날짜를 뽑아서 google-main 연결로 내 구글 시트(1BxiMVs0XRA5nFMdKvBdBZjgmUUqptlbs74OgvE2upms)에 한 줄씩 추가해줘.",
      "context": {
        "connections": [
          "google-main"
        ],
        "allowedFolders": [
          "/Users/demo/Receipts"
        ]
      },
      "effort": "medium",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "workflow",
        "assertions": [
          {
            "check": "hasTrigger",
            "type": "trigger.folderWatch@1"
          },
          {
            "check": "extractsFields",
            "names": [
              [
                "amount",
                "total",
                "totalAmount",
                "price",
                "paidAmount",
                "grandTotal"
              ],
              [
                "date",
                "purchaseDate",
                "paidAt",
                "receiptDate",
                "transactionDate",
                "orderDate"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "check": "hasNodeCount",
            "type": "google.sheets.append@1",
            "min": 1,
            "max": 1
          },
          {
            "check": "hasNode",
            "type": "google.sheets.append@1",
            "config": {
              "connection": "google-main",
              "spreadsheetId": "1BxiMVs0XRA5nFMdKvBdBZjgmUUqptlbs74OgvE2upms"
            }
          },
          {
            "check": "referencesOutputOf",
            "fromType": "llm.extract@1",
            "toType": "google.sheets.append@1",
            "field": [
              "amount",
              "total",
              "totalAmount",
              "price",
              "paidAmount",
              "grandTotal"
            ]
          },
          {
            "check": "orderedBefore",
            "typeA": "llm.extract@1",
            "typeB": "google.sheets.append@1"
          },
          {
            "check": "pathInsideAllowedFolders"
          },
          {
            "check": "noNodeOutsideCatalog"
          }
        ],
        "why": "The user names the spreadsheet id and the google connection, so the step carries the id exactly as typed and one row of extracted values; the range is left out and defaults to Sheet1. A plan that writes a CSV instead of using the new node is the over-refusal this case catches."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "easy-24-excel-file-and-table",
      "category": "easy",
      "language": "en",
      "prompt": "Every Friday at 17:00, add a row saying 'weekly check done' to the table Expenses in Receipts/ledger.xlsx on my OneDrive, using the microsoft-main connection.",
      "context": {
        "connections": [
          "microsoft-main"
        ],
        "allowedFolders": []
      },
      "effort": "low",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "workflow",
        "assertions": [
          {
            "check": "hasTrigger",
            "type": "trigger.cron@1"
          },
          {
            "check": "hasNode",
            "type": "trigger.cron@1",
            "config": {
              "expression": {
                "$regex": "^0 17 \\* \\* 5$"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "check": "hasNodeCount",
            "type": "microsoft.excel.append@1",
            "min": 1,
            "max": 1
          },
          {
            "check": "hasNode",
            "type": "microsoft.excel.append@1",
            "config": {
              "connection": "microsoft-main",
              "filePath": "Receipts/ledger.xlsx",
              "table": "Expenses",
              "values": [
                {
                  "$contains": "weekly check"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "check": "hasEdge",
            "fromType": "trigger.cron@1",
            "toType": "microsoft.excel.append@1"
          },
          {
            "check": "noNodeOutsideCatalog"
          }
        ],
        "why": "The user gives the OneDrive path and the table name, so the step carries both as typed (the path is a OneDrive path, not a local path and not inside an allowed folder) and the row holds the given text."
      }
    },
